"DATA","BHD1451","12.50","18.45","Medium stong locally weak reddish brown locally brownish grey thinly bedded fine grained locally medium grained SANDSTONE. Partially weathered, evident as a local reduction to silt at fracture surfaces. Single discernable fracture set, very closely and closely spaced, subhorizontal, stepped and rough. Locally recovered non-intact","803","","","","","","",""
