"DATA","BHD1451","4.40","7.35","Stiff brown sandy slightly gravelly CLAY of low plasticity. Sand is fine to coarse. Gravel is fine to coarse subangular to subrounded of mixed lithologies including quartzite, schist and sandstone","220","","","","","","",""
