"DATA","BHD1457","IP+CP","","281470.63","853258.81","","21.18","An inspection pit was excavated by hand to a depth of 1.20m to clear services.  Ground-water was encountered at a depth of 2.50m.  The borehole was terminated at the scheduled depth.  A 50mm diameter perforated standpipe was installed to a depth of 6.00m.  The Penetration Tests were carried out using Trip Hammer RD02.","6.00","2017-07-05","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHD1459","IP+CP","","281660.32","853165.95","","26.67","# Description based on Driller's log.  An inspection pit was excavated by hand to a depth of 1.20m to clear services.  Ground-water was encountered at a depth of 5.65m and rose to 5.60m after 20 minutes.  Small amounts of water were added to assist boring at the depths indicated.  The borehole was terminated at the scheduled depth.  A 50mm diameter perforated standpipe was installed to a depth of 6.00m. A data logger was installed in the standpipe.  The Penetration Tests were carried out using Trip Hammer RD02.","6.00","2017-07-03","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHD1461","IP+CP","","281965.49","853398.63","","23.19","# Description based on Driller's log.  An inspection pit was excavated by hand to a depth of 1.20m to clear services.  Ground-water was encountered at a depth of 3.63m and rose to 2.40m after 20 minutes.  A further strike was encountered at a depth of 5.70m and rose to 3.50m after 20 minutes.  Small amounts of water were added to assist boring at the depths indicated.  The Penetration Tests were carried out using Trip Hammer RD21.  Borehole backfilled with arisings and bentonite upon completion.  The borehole was terminated at the scheduled depth.","9.83","2017-06-28","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHD1462","IP+CP","","282014.19","853418.89","","23.70","# Description based on Driller's log.  An inspection pit was excavated by hand to a depth of 1.20m to clear services.  Ground-water was encountered at a depth of 2.20m and rose to 1.95m after 20 minutes.  Small amounts of water were added to assist boring at the depths indicated.  The borehole was terminated at 14.50m due to the cutting shoe shearing down the hole.  Borehole BHD1462A was sunk at an immediatly adjacent location.  The Penetration Tests were carried out using Trip Hammer RD21.  Borehole backfilled with arisings and bentonite upon completion.","14.50","2017-07-04","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
