"DATA","BHD1560","IP+SB+RC","","283121.63","854104.80","","34.24","An inspection pit was excavated by hand to a depth of 1.20m to clear services.  At a depth of 13.55m, ground-water was observed to enter the borehole whilst drilling was suspended overnight, the water level rising to 4.95m.  The Penetration Tests were carried out using Trip Hammer LS250.2016.117.  Borehole terminated having proved 4.95m of bedrock.  Borehole backfilled with cement/bentonite grout upon completion.","17.35","2017-08-05","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
