"DATA","BHD1569","IP+CP+RO+RC","","283574.49","854288.93","","28.32","# Description based on Driller's log. An inspection pit was excavated by hand to a depth of 1.20m to clear services.  Ground-water was encountered at a depth of 2.80m and rose to 2.55m after 20 minutes.  A further strike was encountered at a depth of 16.85m.  A 50mm diameter perforated standpipe was installed to a depth of 12.50m. A variable head permeability test was carried in the standpipe. Thereafter, a data logger was installed in the standpipe.  The Penetration Tests were carried out using Trip Hammer RD12 and RD05.  The borehole was terminated at 19.60m after proving 7.10m of rock.","19.60","2017-06-27","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
